        "candidate_id": "C_6f386c94321d1464_0",
        "edit": "Fix malformed binary literals in the 3'b100 and 3'b111 case arms: 8'b0001_000 -> 8'b0001_0000 and 8'b100_0000 -> 8'b1000_0000, restoring the correct one-hot decoder outputs.",
